WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:06.548
- I’m tryna be the best.

00:00:08.717 --> 00:00:10.176
And everyone’s got a take.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:15.015
I remember from high school to college

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:18.226
hearin’ people say I wasn’t gonna be able to translate my game to college

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:19.185
and now to the NBA.

00:00:21.396 --> 00:00:23.273
Whenever I’m able to get by a defender and

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:26.359
use a couple moves in traffic in the middle of the lane,

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:28.278
it’s because I’ve worked on it.

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:30.572
It’s because I’m comfortable with it.

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.455
When you’ve worked so hard on your craft and your,

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:40.290
your handle and certain moves, 

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.624
the game just slows down for you.

00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:54.804
I think, for me, watchin’ film is the best part.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.807
Technology today is definitely more advanced.

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.064
The fact that you can get every angle

00:01:04.981 --> 00:01:06.357
on one shot,

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.904
and it’s just like a 360 video,

00:01:11.404 --> 00:01:12.155
it’s crazy.

00:01:12.405 --> 00:01:14.491
You know, I think that’s a great technique to get better.

00:01:16.618 --> 00:01:17.577
It’s not the normal thing,

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:20.246
goin’ to the arenas hour-and-a-half early.

00:01:22.248 --> 00:01:25.126
I know I still have a lot to work on, a lot to get better at.

00:01:25.835 --> 00:01:26.711
That’s the best part.

00:01:29.047 --> 00:01:30.799
There’s definitely a couple moves in my bag

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:32.342
that people haven’t seen yet.

